    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Components (no container segments)";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Copy of http://www.researchspace.org/pattern/system/symbolic_object/composed_of whose select and autosuggest exclude P2_has_type dssrc:Container_Segment (MR-38: a segment is a kind, not a class, and must never appear in a generic picker). Insert and delete are identical to the stock field.";
    <http://www.researchspace.org/resource/system/fields/domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object>;
    <http://www.researchspace.org/resource/system/fields/range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object>;
